      "created_at": "2014-08-19T02:53:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've one had both Wraith and Operative on same team, Operative used Hidden Blade Strike, while Wraith had Slip into Shadows. I was able to move Wraith, then sprint next to Operative, activating her hazard spaces, then slip into shadows to avoid them and move even further due to the free sprint, just enough to be within LoS of my target.</p>",
